<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: right">Emerging Growth Company <span id="xdx_901_edei--EntityEmergingGrowthCompany_c20260403__20260403_ziMGYF6D3Rl9"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="AsOf2026-04-03" format="ixt:booleanfalse" id="Fact000028" name="dei:EntityEmergingGrowthCompany">&#9744;</ix:nonNumeric></span></p>

